  {
   "id": "dreadout-2-110164@2023",
   "gameId": "dreadout-2-110164",
   "displayName": "Update 2023",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-20T10:38:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Good day, Agents.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have updated DreadHaunt to version 20231218, and these are notable details that the HQ want to share:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Post-Session Results Screen",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After each session, you’ll be presented with an eye-catching post-result screen. Showing who’s the possessed one, who survived (or didn’t), and how many points you racked up during the mission.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "(Ongoing) Audio Updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We decided to overhaul the Audio System including BGM & SFX assets. You will notice a few changes during gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "(Ongoing) Controller Support",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Controller support is available in very early stage. If you the controller-wielding type of agent, we are looking forward to hear your experiences!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes, Here and There",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added subtitle size option to Settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spectro damage effect +15%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kunti attack charge 25 -> 28.75",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Asih attack charge 10 -> 11.5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prevent drop tools while opening voter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "BugFix: Kunti attack charge hit multiple times",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add condition to disable host quit button when in game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "add descriptions to sprectro skills",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fix mouse cursor not reappearing during waiting for players",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Known Bugs/Glitches",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "BGM not playing on Versus Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Sneak Peek of Future Contents",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have a Content Update Plans on the DreadHaunt store page, check it out here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Last but not least, if you have any suggestions or experienced bugs or glitches about the game, Feel free to reach us out on Steam Community Forum and our official discord server at discord.gg/dreaduniverse",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
