  {
   "id": "dreadout-2-110164@1.1.7",
   "gameId": "dreadout-2-110164",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.7",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-04-09T15:30:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope everything goes well for all of you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On today's updates, we’re adding some tweaks based on user experiences reports, minor bug fixes and improvement on English proofreading as well. We’re still continuing to improve DreadOut 2 as we speak. Let us know if you’re still encountered some problems during your play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The detailed patch are listed in the notes below;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "patch list",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more information, we hope you enjoy DreadOut 2 as much as we do. Be well, stay safe, and Cheers! Again, thank you for your endless support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All the best,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Digital Happiness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "==========================================================================",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Halo semua,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kami berharap semoga semuanya dalam keadaan sehat dan berbahagia selalu!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Untuk update hari ini, kita menambahkan beberapa perbaikan mendasar mengenai pengalaman dan kemudahan bermain dan menambahkan beberapa koreksi teks dalam bahasa Inggris.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rekapan tambahan dari patch adalah sebagai berikut;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "patch list",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tetap bersama kami untuk mendapatkan informasi pembaharuan selanjutnya. Semoga kalian menikmati bermain DreadOut 2, seperti kami pun menikmati saat membuatnya. Tetap sehat, semangat dan sekali lagi terima kasih atas dukungan kalian!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Salam,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Digital Happiness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
