   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-22T13:21:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2020 it’s a really challenging time for all of us, some of our plans and schedules are not well implemented during this unique time. And yet we are very grateful with all of your support, DreadOut 2 is slowly improving and the responses are well received (with 58% mixed reviews during our rocky launch and now 71% mostly positive).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today we have updated DreadOut 2 to version 1.1.5 that contains some minor bug fixes and the most part are adding some new localizations as well. We are adding Hungarian and Spain localization in this update. Shoot out to our friend Brechler Zsolt who helps us with the Hungarian translation, and Alberto Aniorte R for Spanish translation. They both are supporting us since the first DreadOut, really appreciate their help!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The detailed patch are listed in the notes below;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.1.5 patch notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more information, we hope you enjoy DreadOut 2 as much as we do. Be well, stay safe, and Cheers! Again, thank you for your endless support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All the best,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Digital Happiness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "==============================================================================",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Halo semua,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2020 merupakan tahun yang penuh tantangan bagi kita semua, beberapa perencanaan dan skedul kami tidak bisa terimplementasi dengan baik. Namun kami tetap bersyukur dengan dukungan kalian semua. DreadOut 2 secara perlahan membaik dengan dukungan serta respon positif yang terus kami dapatkan (58% mixed reviews saat perilisan awal sampai dengan saat ini di 71% positif reviews)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Menjelang datangnya tahun 2021 tidak lama lagi, kami juga mengucapkan Selamat Hari Natal dan Tahun baru 2021 bagi yang merayakan. Semoga kita semua diberkati dengan kebahagiaan, keriaan dan kesehatan yang baik.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hari ini juga kita telah merilis DreadOut 2 versi 1.1.5 yang berisi beberapa perbaikan revisi minor dan yang paling utama adalah memberikan tambahan subtitle Spanyol dan Hungaria. Terima kasih kepada teman kita Brechler Zsolt, dan Alberto Aniorte R untuk bantuan translasi Hungaria dan Spanyol. Mereka berdua telah mendukung kami sejak DreadOut pertama.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rekapan tambahan dari patch adalah sebagai berikut;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.1.5 patch notes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tetap bersama kami untuk mendapatkan informasi pembaharuan selanjutnya. Semoga kalian menikmati bermain DreadOut 2, seperti kami pun menikmati saat membuatnya. Tetap sehat, semangat dan sekali lagi terima kasih atas dukungan kalian!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Salam hangat selalu and always :p",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Digital Happiness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
