  },
  {
   "id": "dreadout-2-110164@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "dreadout-2-110164",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-02-29T01:30:05.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Recently, we have an update to further improving DreadOut 2 experience, eliminating further newly founded bugs as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update also contains a major change in terms of Achievement trophy, where we removed BURIK achievement as we have told you in previous DreadOut 2 Version 1.0.1 Update patch notes. The BURIK (an anagram of RUBIK) was a Rubik's cube player need to solve and tied to our achievement. Alas, it just brings headache to all of us, both the solver and the game (as some of you might have experienced, it occasionally missing in the level and shown back upon reloading checkpoints).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We do not have an exact answer as to why it happened so randomly except that it possibly related to the collision and numerical stability of the game engine, hence we removed it completely (both the cube and the achievement). The version is bumped to 1.1.0 from 1.0.1 because of this decision. Hope you understand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "For more complete patch notes, see below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Along with this update, we’re still open to any other reports that can potentially reduce your experience while playing DreadOut 2. Stay tuned for more updates from us, as we’re moving into polishing, balancing and tweaking some detail parts that need to be addressed as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DH",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
