  {
   "id": "dreadout-2-110164@1.01",
   "gameId": "dreadout-2-110164",
   "displayName": "Update 1.01",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-02-24T21:30:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thank you for giving us tremendous supports and feedback within our rocky 3 days launch of DreadOut 2. With your support and patience, we will improve DreadOut 2 experience’s that it deserved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Along with this announcement, we have just released our updates and fix to solve some potentially game-breaking progress that players reported. Also, an improvement in user experience as well, save and load, optimizing, tweaking some of the boss battles, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your save game would be fine, so that you can continue your progress through there. This fix may not solve all of the issues that players encountered. But we can only promise that we will be continually updating our build. You can look at all the details of bug fixing through here;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please kindly updates your game with our latest build. We are really encouraging everyone to keep posting and report any issues along the way and share your experience with us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All the best,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DH",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
